<title>USA: Fannie Mae to redeem $450 mln issue.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae to redeem $450 mln issue.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal National Mortgage Association on Tuesday said it will redeem all $450 million of oustanding series SM-2001-G, 8.04 percent debentures due October 10, 2001.</p>
<p>Fannie Mae had issued the debentures on Oct 10, 1991.</p>
<p>The redemption price will be equal to 100 percent of principal amount redeemed plus accrued interest thereon to date of redemption, Fannie Mae said.</p>
</text>
